{"sourceUrl":"https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/item/23451.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:51.927845+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/item/23451.html","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  依据教育部相关要求及《北京交通大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年招收推荐免试攻读硕士（博士）研究生办法》，为选拔优秀学生推荐免试攻读我院硕士（博士）学位，并使招生工作“公平、公正、公开”，特制订本方案。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>一、推免生招收工作原则</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span><span>1.</span><span>推免生招生工作包括考核复试、研招网拟录取和其他录取流程</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>部分。学院推免工作将于</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日开展</span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span><span>推免选拔：①获得本科院校保研资格；②参加我院复试且成绩</span><span>60</span><span>分以上（见“二、推免选拔流程”）；③按照规定时间及要求完成研招网拟录取流程（见“三、研招网拟录取流程”）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>二、推免选拔流程</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>申请条件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  ①拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  ②本科专业应为相关理学专业（系统科学与工程、数学、统计、物理等）；或交通运输类本科专业；或管理类专业；或计算机、自动化、通信工程等工学专业。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  ③获得推荐学校推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生（如所在学校尚未完成推免资格评定工作，但预计可取得推免生资格者，也可申请）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  ④学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  ⑤身心健康，符合规定的体检要求。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2.</span><span>推免选拔报名</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>推免选拔报名系统网址：</span></span></span></span><a href=\"https://gsadmission.bjtu.edu.cn/recommend/signin/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u><span><span><span><u><span>https://gsadmission.bjtu.edu.cn/recommend/signin/</span></u></span></span></span></u></a></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>报名时间：</span>9<span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span>0:00<span>至</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>24</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>:00</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  材料准备：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  ①有效居民身份证；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  ②学信网学籍在线验证报告；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  ③本科成绩单，要求加盖学生所在学校教务处公章；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  ④</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学术科研成果（公开发表的论文、出版专著等）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>国家英语四（六）级成绩单、获奖证书等；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  ⑤</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>申请直接攻读博士研究生者（直博生）还须提供《</span></span><span>直博生个人陈述表》（附件</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>）、两位申请攻读学位学科领域内的教授（或相当专业技术职称）专家的《直博生专家推荐书》（附件</span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  以上申请材料由考生在我校推免预报名系统上传电子版图片，可通过对原件进行扫描或拍照生成，上传电子版为</span><span>pdf</span><span>或</span><span>jpg</span><span>格式，每个附件大小不超过</span><span>1M</span><span>。申请人必须保证全部申请材料以及网上报名信息的真实性和准确性。如果申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确，我校将取消申请人推免录取资格，并通报申请人所在学校，责任由申请人自负。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>其他说明：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>①</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>报名系统中需要上传的附件请按照其要求上传，如确无该附件，可用空白图片替代上传；</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>②</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>由于该系统由本校多个学院共同使用，</span>9<span>月</span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>24</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>:00<span>后该系统依旧开放，但超过报名时间的志愿学院视为无效志愿；</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>③</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>推免填报的志愿不区分硕士和直博，统一进行面试，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>最终</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>按照面试成绩择优录取。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.<span>复试</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>流程</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>复试采用线下方式开展</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，由基本材料审核和</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>综合能力面试</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>两部分构成</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>基本材料审核环节，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>考生</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>线上</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>提交材料后，专家组（不少于</span>5<span>人）将结合考生学术研究经历、本科课程成绩、个人陈述等情况给出对应成绩，成绩满分</span><span>100</span><span>分，保留</span><span>2</span><span>位小数，该成绩占复试总成绩的</span><span>30%</span><span>。综合能力面试</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>考核内容包括外语能力测试、专业及综合能力测试两部分。外语能力测试主要考查考生的外语听力及口语水平。专业及综合能力测试主要考查考生大学阶段学习情况及成绩；对本学科（专业）理论知识和应用技能掌握程度；利用所学理论发现、分析和解决问题的能力；对本学科发展动态的了解以及在本专业领域发展的潜力；创新精神和创新能力；思想政治素质和道德品质；本学科（专业）以外的学习、科研、社会实践（学生工作、社团活动、志愿服务等）或实际工作表现等方面的情况；事业心、责任感、纪律性（遵纪守法）、协作性；心理健康情况；人文素养；举止、表达和礼仪等。每位考生面试时间不少于</span><span>20</span><span>分钟，其中包括不超过</span><span>8</span><span>分钟的个人展示环节（中文），个人展示环节考生可自行准备</span><span>PPT</span><span>。</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>面试成绩满分</span>100<span>分，保留</span><span>2</span><span>位小数，该成绩占复试总成绩的</span><span>70%</span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>另，复试结束后我院将通过</span></span></span><span><span><span>邮件或手机短信</span></span></span><span><span><span>通知等方式向获得拟录取资格的考生发送在线心理测评题目，请各位同学核对报名时系统中填报的手机号码和电子邮箱，确保可接收到测评短信信息。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>具体流程如下：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>环节</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>时间</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>方式</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>报名</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9<span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span>0:00-9<span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>12</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>24</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>:00</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>夏令营报名的同学也需要再次报名。</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>请在系统中准确填写身份证号、手机号、电子信箱等个人信息，避免因个人信息填写不准确延误通知及信息获取。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>基本材料审核</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>14</span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>线上审核材料。确定复试名单，发送复试通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>确认复试</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>15</span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>考生在预报名系统中确认复试，缴费复试费</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>综合能力面试</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9<span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>18</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>面试分组名单及地点届时会公布在</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>网站。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>心理测评</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>具体安排届时学院网站通知</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>三、研招网录取流程</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>研招网推免生招生功能预计将于</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>22</span><span>日</span><span>9:00</span><span>开通，考生须按照如下要求完成研招网拟录取流程的各个环节。此外请各位考生在研招网设置短信提示，以便第一时间获取相关通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span>环节</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span>时间</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span>注意</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>事项</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>申报</span></span></span><span><span><span>志愿</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span>月</span><span>22</span><span>日</span><span>9:00</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>鉴于研招网网络拥堵情况，请各位考</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>生尽可能提早完成志愿申报。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>复试</span></span></span><span><span><span>通知</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span>月</span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span>日</span><span>9:</span></span></span><span><span>00</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学院会在该时间内一次性对考生发放复试通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>复试</span></span></span><span><span><span>确认</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span>月</span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span>日</span><span>9:3</span></span></span><span><span>0</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>考生须在收到复试通知后在半小时内登录研招网确认复试。逾期未确认的视为放弃拟录取资格，空余名额将递补录取。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>拟</span></span></span><span><span><span>录取通知</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span>月</span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span>日</span><span>9:</span></span></span><span><span>00</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学院会在该时间内分批次对已确认复试的考生发放拟录取通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>拟录取</span></span></span><span><span><span>确认</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span>月</span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span>日14</span><span>:3</span></span></span><span><span>0</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>拟录取一旦确认，学院和考生双方将达成拟录取协定，拟录取资格将无法取消。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>四、其他录取流程</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span><span>1.</span><span>复试缴费</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  考生除在研招网上缴纳报名费外，还须在北京交通大学推免生缴费系统缴纳复试费（缴费网址：</span><span>https://gsadmission.bjtu.edu.cn/recommend/signin_new/</span><span>），未缴费者视为放弃拟录取资格。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span><span>2.</span><span>导师选取</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  考生可根据“研究生院</span><span>-</span><span>招生专题</span><span>-</span><span>导师在线”的导师信息提前联系导师。获得拟录取资格的考生须填写《考生报考导师意向表》（附件</span><span>3</span><span>），考生和第一志愿导师签字确认后（或电子签名），于</span><span>10</span><span>月</span><span>15</span><span>日前将电子版扫描件发回至</span><span>xtyjs@bjtu.edu.cn</span><span>，邮件标题及附件须以“推免导师申报</span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>身份证号”命名。至</span><span>10</span><span>月</span><span>15</span><span>日尚未联系到导师的考生，请发送标题为“服从学院调剂导师</span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>身份证号”的邮件即可，学院将协助安排导师。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span><span>3.</span><span>政审调档</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  学院拟定于</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>5</span><span>月（统考结束后）对获得拟录取资格的考生进行政审、调档等相关正式录取工作，届时会在系统科学学院网站招生信息栏公布，请各位考生注意查看。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  咨询电话：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>010-51683631</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，邮箱</span><span>xtyjs@bjtu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>系统科学学院研究生办公室</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h4>附件：</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/media/attachments/2025/09/20250914162152_823.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：直博生个人陈述表.doc</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/media/attachments/2025/09/20250914162152_923.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：直博生专家推荐书.doc</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/media/attachments/2025/09/20250914162152_355.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件3：考生报考导师意向表.doc</a>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<div></div>\n</div>","textSha256":"62f97c4dc3b955c4f556bc2043374cce0dd21435464970b2c3c4243c6539f31f","textLength":2658,"sourceSha256":"2fd50fe5229902e57dcd622281cd597338d13c076754733752bd5f7f85b2b468","selector":".article-content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a38847849aab2a0415b2","title":"2025年北京交通大学系统科学学院2026年招收推荐免试攻读硕士博士研究生工作方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:51.927845+00:00"}
